    state verified
    result pass
    method observation
    observed_at git:72b01427f8bb0ef32794e5ecc67fe6a3dae2912e
    summary """
        Seams audited: transport reads into self-owned buffer with split_to on complete frames so timed-out receives lose nothing, 16MiB frame cap; asymmetric ut_metadata ids 3/7 prove directional mapping with id-0 rejected; announce gated by TrackerClock one-in-flight plus interval/backoff with direct peer route in this milestone; rejected blocks attribute supplier peer in SessionReport.blamed with retry, scoring/quarantine deferred
        """
}

