record templartorrent.evidence.persistence-driver/1 : evidence {
    title "Ubuntu 26.04.1 x86_64 i7-13700H, rustc 1.99.0, tree at bc5a250 plus the persistence changes: 23 adapter driver tests passed including driver_export_and_restore_job_record_rechecks_without_peers. A completed job with one file deselected, order [1,0] and Block/Avoid preferences exported a record whose envelope reproduces the fixture magnet; a fresh Driver restored it to Complete from disk with the same destination, selection, order and preferences, zero connections and zero requests to the still-running seeder; a duplicate restore and a tampered or mismatched record were refused with the job intact. A paused partial job restored as Paused with its verified bytes, resumed with only a saved loopback HTTP tracker, obtained the peer from that tracker and completed without re-requesting the adopted piece. Engine regression test selection_changes_resettle_completion_without_a_new_piece passed."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:bc5a25057784b680316a863936561d5836a65716
    command "cargo test -p templartorrent-rbit-adapter --test driver"
    artifact "perf-results/2026-10-22-persistence/workspace-tests.log"
    summary """
