record templartorrent.evidence.picker-oracle-equivalence/1 : evidence {
    title "Ubuntu 26.04.1 x86_64 i7-13700H, rustc 1.99.0, tree 1a8d451 plus the picker change: 151 workspace tests passed. New core picker tests: 400 random sequences (1 to 6 files, zero-length files, random wanted and order, random verified, busy and availability) each checked against 9 random peers, the picked piece carries the oracle's (rank, availability) key and is eligible for that peer, or both pick None; 200 sequences each with 60 incremental mutations (availability, lease and release, verify and invalidate with rank rebuilds, selection toggles) compared field by field with a fresh rebuild and against the oracle; availability above 1023 clamps without dropping pieces. The engine and adapter suites pass with four assertions restated from lowest-index order to rank and adopted-byte terms, which DESIGN.md permits for the live engine."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:1a8d451aecf058c880b14445f215a5c52c7019f6
    command "cargo test --workspace --all-targets"
    artifact "perf-results/2026-10-22-picker/workspace-tests.log"
    summary """
